[{"client_msg_id":"0C41617A-B8CB-4E6A-AB2F-44E9D59A08C5","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ふむたしかに","ts":"1628674511.360400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9hT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6702680c-698e-4682-9f44-5060fd254fc8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"現代にあっては一瞬ですな。もち数にもよりますけども。","ts":"1628674488.360200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cMOk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a88a449b-c9b5-41d7-ab49-c9b59e584f73","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Sprite に z の概念もたせてソートするのって実際そんなコストかからないと思うんですけど、どうなんでしょう?","ts":"1628674278.359200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"htZ4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4393d28d-3097-45dc-8cee-ca7504a7af02","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"多分こっちの方が安定して出力できるんじゃないかなと思います。","ts":"1628669088.357000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"two_hearts","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"74x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c7af954-1611-4697-a98a-e033b03b6cb4","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あとは本末転倒かもしれないですが、Rustでどうしてもゲームを作りたいというなら「Bevy」というライブラリがあります。\n\u003chttps://bevyengine.org/\u003e","ts":"1628669056.356500","thread_ts":"1628669056.356500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Bevy - A data-driven game engine built in Rust","id":1,"title":"Bevy - A data-driven game engine built in Rust","title_link":"https://bevyengine.org/","text":"Bevy is a refreshingly simple data-driven game engine built in Rust. It is free and open-source forever!","image_url":"https://bevyengine.org/assets/bevy_logo_fill.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"bevyengine.org","service_icon":"https://bevyengine.org/assets/favicon.png","from_url":"https://bevyengine.org/","original_url":"https://bevyengine.org/"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T0