,"type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"元の話に戻って、レイヤー内での描画順はどうするのが良い感じです?","ts":"1628665127.352100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bxyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fff71b0b-9d8b-4bb4-bb21-43006bed4ad7","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"今だと半透明描画自体はどのエンジンも隠蔽してくれてるけど重いことは変わりないですからね","ts":"1628665003.351600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jDh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36b25747-13eb-4219-b82a-355057733752","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"最近で印象に残ったのは、モンハンライズが半透明がなくてドット抜けで表現してること\n今でもやるんだーと思った","ts":"1628664903.351000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U7JL1UKKL","U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIOg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2f892d5-ab2e-411f-ab2c-58cf468d4966","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さんざんやった","ts":"1628664894.350700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vd=1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"199e3120-6e52-4004-bb04-0370dab3cdac","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あー半透明はそうですね！","ts":"1628664879.350100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f38f68f-d379-4ea3-839d-5bb0a6b27044","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"結局ソート必須になる。","ts":"1628664874.349900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ut9P0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54a7e699-2825-432f-bf67-c2443eaf5bed","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あと「分離しようと思わない」も割と有力な手でした","ts":"1628664872.349800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ROds"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f1f5b00-1860-4ab5-820f-fd8e9d1c0c96","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"昔の3Dですけど、透過オブジェクトがあると描画順が効くのでね。","ts":"1628664867.349500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zXww1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b647568-1cfb-413d-b96d-17667ff85feb","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ソートはやっぱりコストが気になる","ts":"1628664822.348800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Az/7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5456b783-2281-46f6-9d95-3a999ee25df9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"です\nなので簡易的に数枚のレイヤーを用意するような形で実装するのがたぶん一番楽という結論になりました","ts":"1628664807.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lg/V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ac491bb-274f-436d-941c-6bd020cccdf3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"レイヤーとかはZ軸の概念ですね","ts":"1628664778.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ilpnA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1875be0b-fd82-47b9-abfe-db715e07ac01","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"たとえば素直に「弾の配列」「敵の配列」を用意して、種類ごとに弾が上だったり逆に敵が上だったりするとき、描画順を制御するのはクソめんどい","ts":"1628664770.347800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53f8493c-abeb-4bd6-bebd-6d4ead44f4c8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ゲームでロジックとビューを切り離す方法について考えてたんですけど、\n2Dだと描画順が画像の重なりに影響するので制御が思いのほかめんどいのに気づきました\n3Dだと描画順とかなくてZ軸で並び替えられるので案外楽なことに気づきました\n2Dでやろうと思うとZ軸相当を自分で実装しなくちゃない、3Dだとゲームプログラマーは一切意識しなくていいのに","ts":"1628664708.347100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nlc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8970936c-b7a8-4612-b893-ef0e7a9d1b10","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Metal より GL のほうが安定して動くケースが稀によくある","ts":"1628654598.345400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MF