and macOS, plus MoltenGL, a faster implementation of OpenGL ES 2.0 on iOS and macOS.","thumb_url":"https://moltengl.com/wp-content/uploads/moltengl_header_logo_horizontal_55.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Molten","service_icon":"https://moltengl.com/wp-content/uploads/cropped-molten_site_icon_512-180x180.png","thumb_width":199,"thumb_height":55,"from_url":"https://moltengl.com/","original_url":"https://moltengl.com/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HupRT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36fd8cef-1489-4575-a62e-0f05761eaa14","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Vulkanだけだったかな…？","ts":"1628645428.336100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vnGx2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1816fcf-14d9-43b7-824e-a86b1afc9832","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"macOSだとOpenGLが互換レイヤー経由（Metal）になってなかった？","ts":"1628645262.335500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rC=vC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EB428626-F508-421C-8AAE-4C806DFD04C6","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/rg3dengine/rg3d|rg3d\u003e が mac では全然動かなかった (0.5 FPS とかになる) のですが、原因は分かりますか……？　OpenGL の実装が悪いのかなと思ったのですが","ts":"1628644360.334700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"rg3dengine/rg3d","id":1,"title":"rg3dengine/rg3d","text":"3D and 2D game engine written in Rust","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://rg3d.rs\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"2188","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6y87"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc8bf92f-a220-467a-bf6d-c3cf2e297cc0","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"mac といえば、 OpenGL の 3D 機能が異常に重かったりしません？","ts":"1628641852.331400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"block